WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:58.500
[Anxious Synth Drone and Piano Motif Crushed by Pounding Industrial Beat]

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.000
TOO LOUD! TOO BRIGHT!

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.550
TOO MANY! WRONG!

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:05.792
THIS ISN'T RIGHT!

00:01:05.792 --> 00:01:08.000
THIS ISN'T RIGHT!

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.295
MY ROOM! MY NAME!

00:01:10.315 --> 00:01:12.500
THE NOISE! THE NOISE!

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.419
THE SYSTEM'S CRASHED!

00:01:17.281 --> 00:01:20.000
CAN'T BREATHE! CAN'T THINK!

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.000
GOTTA GET OUT! I'M ON THE BRINK!

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.270
IT'S ALL WRONG! IT'S ALL WRONG!

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:30.200
THIS ISN'T ME!

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.053
THIS ISN'T ME!

00:01:32.053 --> 00:02:05.452
[Frantic Pounding Industrial Assault]

00:02:05.452 --> 00:02:08.500
THEY'RE STARING! THEY'RE WATCHING!

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:12.500
A MISTAKE! I'M THE MISTAKE!

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.477
HAVE TO MOVE! HAVE TO PACK!

00:02:16.818 --> 00:02:19.000
CAN'T DO IT AGAIN!

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.100
THE NOISE!

00:02:23.861 --> 00:02:26.000
CAN'T BREATHE! CAN'T THINK!

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.000
GOTTA GET OUT! I'M ON THE BRINK!

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.000
IT'S ALL WRONG! IT'S ALL WRONG!

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.881
THIS ISN'T ME! THIS ISN'T ME!

00:02:31.881 --> 00:03:17.191
[Frantic Heartbeat Pulse and Panted Breathing]

00:03:17.191 --> 00:03:20.000
It's too much...

00:03:20.897 --> 00:03:24.000
It's too much...

00:03:24.622 --> 00:03:28.000
It's too much...

00:03:28.327 --> 00:03:32.000
IT'S TOO MUCH!

00:03:32.000 --> 00:04:15.240
[Final Chaotic Industrial Bar Cuts Abruptly to Silence]
